@* A link's line on the pencil map: a pencil curve for a choice, the same curve in leader dots for a
   follow-up (docs/design/0002-visual-direction.md §10.3), in ribbon while selected (§12.5). Its
   label is SceneEdgeLabel, drawn in a layer above every line. A double-click on a link is the
   link's, not the paper's: it adds no scene. A link leaving a scene the report blames takes its
   severity (§13.3). *@
<g class="@GroupClass" @onclick="OnSelected" @ondblclick:stopPropagation>
    @if (IsChoice)
    {
        <title>@Edge.Label</title>
    }

    <path class="edge-line" d="@Edge.PathData" marker-end="@Marker" />
    <path class="edge-hit" d="@Edge.PathData" />
</g>
